  visitPurpose: Abyss biome. Come here for specialized runs, rarer materials, and
    follow strong natural shapes and search obvious pockets.
  commonRewardHook: Reliable value comes from Electrolyte Salts and Hydrocarbon Resin.
  rareRewardHook: 'The rare pull is real: Sulfur Clumps and Pump Rotor.'
  landmarkIdentity: Methane Mounds reads through spires, steps, and big natural crowns.
    Landmarks should feel scarce but memorable.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets are scarce. Relief should come from one clear
    nook, not constant cover.
