    for loot. Creature pressure stays high.'
  extractionFocus: 'Harvest concentrated hotspots, then move before the zone punishes
    greed. Mid-depth: favor stone pockets and hard-form nodes, then return before
    greed stretches the route.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is brine bowl or vent pocket. This slot should
    read through brine pool chain and active vent arc; use vertical forms to keep
    heading.
